1
00:00:00,076 --> 00:00:05,686
Chart it before the next patient sits down. — Clock on screen. Nothing cut out.

2
00:00:10,316 --> 00:00:16,103
One record. The note and the order are tabs of it.

3
00:00:16,103 --> 00:00:23,927
Findings go in once.

4
00:00:23,927 --> 00:00:31,356
Same record. No new system.

5
00:00:31,356 --> 00:00:38,400
Ordered by code, so the lab and the claim describe the same test.

6
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:49,779
And who gets the result when it lands.

7
00:00:49,779 --> 00:00:54,582
The result files itself back to this chart. Nobody scans anything.

8
00:00:55,914 --> 00:01:01,104
One record. One pass. — Documented and ordered — without leaving the chart.
